{
 "_readme": "Round 6 of the frozen protocol in lit-targets-cross-disease-endpoints.json. FULL ClinicalTrials.gov v2 records for the 12 trials contributing a control arm with a complete four-cell best-response table. The round-4 pull deliberately limited `fields` to keep 156 MB of payload readable, and that dropped exactly the modules the placebo calibration needs: eligibility (was documented progression required at entry -- the field that decides the DIRECTION of the natural-history bound), design (masking, crossover), arms and interventions (background therapy), outcomes (imaging interval and assessor), and participant flow (pre-crossover denominators). Twelve records rather than a sweep, because these are the only trials whose control arms can currently be re-read at all.",
